{"title":"Rock Scorpion","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 29 Scorpion that attacks with stab (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">stab</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">corrode</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">slash</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 2 times (2.4% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      <p class=\"s\">Special: carapaceFlat: 2 | venomChance: .3 | venomDamage: 12</p>\n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/deathstalker-venom\">Deathstalker Venom</a> <span class=\"muted\">(infuses an enchant)</span>. A small chance on any kill, far better from elites. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/rock-scorpion\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/rock-scorpion?lv=27\">Lv 27 <span>2</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/rock-scorpion?lv=28\">Lv 28 <span>3</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/rock-scorpion?lv=29\">Lv 29 <span>81</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/rock-scorpion?lv=30\">Lv 30 <span>78</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/rock-scorpion?lv=31\">Lv 31 <span>25</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/rock-scorpion?lv=32\">Lv 32 <span>12</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/rock-scorpion?lv=27\" title=\"Pick level 27\"><td><b>27</b></td><td>100</td><td>19.4</td><td>1,350</td><td class=\"muted\">300 · 27.2 · 4,050</td><td>2</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Scorpion%20Pits\">Scorpion Pits</a></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/rock-scorpion\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>28</b></td><td>106</td><td>19.9</td><td>1,400</td><td class=\"muted\">318 · 27.9 · 4,200</td><td>3</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Scorpion%20Pits\">Scorpion Pits</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/rock-scorpion?lv=29\" title=\"Pick level 29\"><td><b>29</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>111</td><td>20.5</td><td>1,450</td><td class=\"muted\">333 · 28.7 · 4,350</td><td>81</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Agauton\">Agauton</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/rock-scorpion?lv=30\" title=\"Pick level 30\"><td><b>30</b></td><td>118</td><td>21</td><td>1,500</td><td class=\"muted\">354 · 29.4 · 4,500</td><td>78</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Agauton\">Agauton</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/rock-scorpion?lv=31\" title=\"Pick level 31\"><td><b>31</b></td><td>124</td><td>21.6</td><td>1,550</td><td class=\"muted\">372 · 30.2 · 4,650</td><td>25</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Old%20Thak%20Muster%20Ground\">Old Thak Muster Ground</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/rock-scorpion?lv=32\" title=\"Pick level 32\"><td><b>32</b></td><td>131</td><td>22.1</td><td>1,600</td><td class=\"muted\">393 · 30.9 · 4,800</td><td>12</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Old%20Thak%20Muster%20Ground\">Old Thak Muster Ground</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"rock-scorpion\" data-map-level=\"28\">Show level 28 on the map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class